    "Or type a login for this turn only": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Or type a login for this turn only"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ou tapez un identifiant pour ce tour seulement"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ou digite um login só para este turno"}}}},
    "User name": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "User name"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nom d'utilisateur"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nome de usuário"}}}},
    "Password": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Password"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mot de passe"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Senha"}}}},
    "This turn only": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "This turn only"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ce tour seulement"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Só este turno"}}}},
    "Never saved. Sagax forgets it when this turn ends.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Never saved. Sagax forgets it when this turn ends."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Jamais enregistré. Sagax l'oublie à la fin de ce tour."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nunca é salvo. O Sagax o esquece quando este turno termina."}}}},
    "this turn only, not saved": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "this turn only, not saved"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ce tour seulement, non enregistré"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "só este turno, não salvo"}}}},
    "Show password": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Show password"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Afficher le mot de passe"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mostrar senha"}}}},
    "Show key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Show key"}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Afficher la clé"}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Mostrar chave"}}}},
    "Live: signed in on your computer. Sagax asks it for a one-time card after you allow a purchase.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Live: signed in on your computer. Sagax asks it for a one-time card after you allow a purchase."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "En service : connecté sur votre ordinateur. Sagax lui demande une carte à usage unique après votre accord."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ativo: conectado no seu computador. O Sagax pede um cartão de uso único depois que você aprova uma compra."}}}},
    "Shop Pay and Link are wallets you already have. Sagax asks that wallet for a one-time card only after you allow the purchase, through the wallet's own command line tool signed in on your computer. The site does not receive a saved card number, and the bot never sees it.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Shop Pay and Link are wallets you already have. Sagax asks that wallet for a one-time card only after you allow the purchase, through the wallet's own command line tool signed in on your computer. The site does not receive a saved card number, and the bot never sees it."}}, "fr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Shop Pay et Link sont des portefeuilles que vous avez déjà. Sagax demande une carte à usage unique seulement après votre accord, par l'outil en ligne de commande du portefeuille connecté sur votre ordinateur. Le site ne reçoit pas le numéro enregistré, et le bot ne le voit pas."}}, "pt-BR": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Shop Pay e Link são carteiras que você já tem. O Sagax pede um cartão de uso único só depois que você aprova a compra, pela ferramenta de linha de comando da carteira conectada no seu computador. O site não recebe o número salvo, e o bot nunca o vê."}}}},
