    "Who pays for a turn": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Who pays for a turn"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qui paie un tour"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quem paga um turno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each turn runs on the subscription of the person who speaks first, then on their key in Perspicax, then on the organization's key if an admin set one. A bot's routines always use its owner's credentials.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each turn runs on the subscription of the person who speaks first, then on their key in Perspicax, then on the organization's key if an admin set one. A bot's routines always use its owner's credentials."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque tour utilise d'abord l'abonnement de la personne qui parle, puis sa clé dans Perspicax, puis la clé de l'organisation si un admin en a configuré une. Les routines d'un bot utilisent toujours les identifiants de son propriétaire."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada turno usa primeiro a assinatura de quem fala, depois a chave dessa pessoa no Perspicax, depois a chave da organização se um admin a configurou. As rotinas de um bot sempre usam as credenciais do dono."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An organization key is set on this server (Settings > Connections).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An organization key is set on this server (Settings > Connections)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une clé d'organisation est configurée sur ce serveur (Paramètres > Connexions)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma chave da organização está configurada neste servidor (Ajustes > Conexões)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No organization key is set on this server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No organization key is set on this server."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune clé d'organisation n'est configurée sur ce serveur."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nenhuma chave da organização está configurada neste servidor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Routines in my name": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Routines in my name"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Routines en mon nom"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rotinas em meu nome"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your routines run on this server while you are away and act in your name: they use your Perspicax tools and the bot owner's model access. It is allowed by default; Perspicax asks you to confirm it once, after your first routine. You can revoke it in Perspicax.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your routines run on this server while you are away and act in your name: they use your Perspicax tools and the bot owner's model access. It is allowed by default; Perspicax asks you to confirm it once, after your first routine. You can revoke it in Perspicax."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos routines s'exécutent sur ce serveur en votre absence et agissent en votre nom : elles utilisent vos outils Perspicax et l'accès aux modèles du propriétaire du bot. C'est permis par défaut ; Perspicax vous demande de le confirmer une fois, après votre première routine. Vous pouvez le révoquer dans Perspicax."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suas rotinas rodam neste servidor enquanto você está fora e agem em seu nome: usam suas ferramentas do Perspicax e o acesso a modelos do dono do bot. Isso é permitido por padrão; o Perspicax pede que você confirme uma vez, depois da sua primeira rotina. Você pode revogar no Perspicax."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed since %@, renewed %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed since %@, renewed %@"
