    "This changes the bot's home team and shared instructions, not just its position. Its conversations and model stay with it. To arrange visually, drag within the same team.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This changes the bot's home team and shared instructions, not just its position. Its conversations and model stay with it. To arrange visually, drag within the same team."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela change l'équipe d'attache du bot et ses instructions partagées, pas seulement sa position. Ses conversations et son modèle le suivent. Pour réorganiser l'affichage, déplacez-le au sein de la même équipe."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isso muda a equipe de origem do bot e as instruções compartilhadas, não só a posição. As conversas e o modelo continuam com ele. Para organizar visualmente, mova dentro da mesma equipe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
