          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every change to these files, whoever made it. Undo puts a file back the way it was before that change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every change to these files, whoever made it. Undo puts a file back the way it was before that change."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque changement de ces fichiers, peu importe qui l'a fait. Annuler remet un fichier comme il était avant ce changement."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toda alteração nestes arquivos, seja de quem for. Desfazer devolve um arquivo ao que era antes dessa alteração."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete %@? The journal below can bring it back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete %@? The journal below can bring it back."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprimer %@? Le journal ci-dessous peut le ramener."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Excluir %@? O histórico abaixo pode trazê-lo de volta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This bot's engine can't make the quick background model call upkeep uses, so it only archives expired notes and merges exact duplicates. Claude and chat-model engines can do the rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This bot's engine can't make the quick background model call upkeep uses, so it only archives expired notes and merges exact duplicates. Claude and chat-model engines can do the rest."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le moteur de ce bot ne peut pas faire l'appel de modèle rapide en arrière-plan qu'utilise l'entretien : il archive seulement les notes expirées et fusionne les doublons exacts. Claude et les moteurs de modèles de chat font le reste."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O motor deste bot não consegue fazer a chamada rápida de modelo em segundo plano que a manutenção usa, então só arquiva notas expiradas e mescla duplicatas exatas. Claude e motores de modelos de chat fazem o resto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tidying…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tidying…"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rangement…"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrumando…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tidy up now": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tidy up now"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ranger maintenant"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrumar agora"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps these notes in shape without the bot having to remember to: notices facts you mention in chats and files them (core facts here, detail in topic files it creates) and tidies up every night: expired notes are archived, duplicates merged, contradicted notes crossed out. Facts about you are added to About me (Settings → General), where every bot reads them and you can remove any. Every change shows below and can be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps these notes in shape without the bot having to remember to: notices facts you mention in chats and files them (core facts here, detail in topic files it creates) and tidies up every night: expired notes are archived, duplicates merged, contradicted notes crossed out. Facts about you are added to About me (Settings → General), where every bot reads them and you can remove any. Every change shows below and can be undone."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garde ces notes en ordre sans que le bot ait à y penser : il remarque les faits que vous mentionnez dans les discussions et les classe (l'essentiel ici, le détail dans des fichiers de sujets qu'il crée), et range chaque nuit : les notes expirées sont archivées, les doublons fusionnés, les notes contredites barrées. Les faits à votre sujet vont dans À propos de moi (Réglages → Général), où chaque bot les lit et où vous pouvez les retirer. Chaque changement s'affiche ci-dessous et peut être annulé."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mantém estas notas em ordem sem o bot precisar lembrar: percebe fatos que você menciona nas conversas e os arquiva (o essencial aqui, os detalhes em arquivos de tópicos que ele cria) e arruma tudo toda noite: notas expiradas são arquivadas, duplicatas mescladas, notas contraditas riscadas. Fatos sobre você vão para Sobre mim (Ajustes → Geral), onde todo bot os lê e você pode removê-los. Toda alteração aparece abaixo e pode ser desfeita."
          }
        }
      }
    },
