    "Routines use the tools of the person they run as. That person needs a recent sign-in to Sagax; a run while they have none goes without these tools until they sign in again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Routines use the tools of the person they run as. That person needs a recent sign-in to Sagax; a run while they have none goes without these tools until they sign in again."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les routines utilisent les outils de la personne au nom de qui elles s'exécutent. Cette personne doit s'être connectée récemment à Sagax ; sinon, l'exécution se fait sans ces outils jusqu'à sa prochaine connexion."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As rotinas usam as ferramentas da pessoa em nome de quem rodam. Essa pessoa precisa ter entrado no Sagax recentemente; sem isso, a execução segue sem essas ferramentas até ela entrar de novo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can only add a profile you hold in Perspicax.": {
