    "Claude Code plugins from a marketplace (owner/repo or an https git address). Their skills, commands and agents load in this bot's turns; hooks and the plugin's own MCP servers are left out because they would run on the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code plugins from a marketplace (owner/repo or an https git address). Their skills, commands and agents load in this bot's turns; hooks and the plugin's own MCP servers are left out because they would run on the server."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plugins Claude Code d'une marketplace (owner/repo ou une adresse git https). Leurs compétences, commandes et agents se chargent dans les tours de ce robot; les hooks et les serveurs MCP du plugin sont retirés, car ils s'exécuteraient sur le serveur."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plugins do Claude Code de um marketplace (owner/repo ou um endereço git https). As skills, os comandos e os agentes deles carregam nos turnos deste bot; hooks e os servidores MCP do próprio plugin ficam de fora porque rodariam no servidor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
