    "When this many runs fail in a row, the routine pauses itself and tells you. Resume turns it back on and starts the count again. Failed runs stay in the history.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "When this many runs fail in a row, the routine pauses itself and tells you. Resume turns it back on and starts the count again. Failed runs stay in the history." } },
        "fr": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Quand autant d'exécutions échouent de suite, la routine se met en pause et vous le dit. Relancer la réactive et remet le compte à zéro. Les exécutions échouées restent dans l'historique." } }
      }
