          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Bot designer asks you the questions and fills in each step live. It is created for you, as your own bot, the moment you choose this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Bot designer asks you the questions and fills in each step live. It is created for you, as your own bot, the moment you choose this."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre Concepteur de bots vous pose les questions et remplit chaque étape en direct. Il est créé pour vous, comme votre propre bot, dès que vous choisissez ceci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect an engine first: the bot that guides you needs one to answer. You can also fill it in yourself right now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
