        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un résumé de votre bot. Modifier ouvre une étape ; essayez-le avec un premier message avant de terminer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its role in one sentence, shown in rosters, on the phone and to other bots. Longer instructions go in the Soul step.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its role in one sentence, shown in rosters, on the phone and to other bots. Longer instructions go in the Soul step."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son rôle en une phrase, affiché dans les listes, sur le téléphone et aux autres bots. Les instructions plus longues vont à l'étape Soul."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A role fills in the role sentence, a starting soul and the suggestions of the next steps. Everything stays editable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A role fills in the role sentence, a starting soul and the suggestions of the next steps. Everything stays editable."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un rôle remplit la phrase de rôle, une soul de départ et les suggestions des étapes suivantes. Tout reste modifiable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rules apply before the approval level, whatever the level. An effect you pick is saved at once for this bot; Off removes the rule.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rules apply before the approval level, whatever the level. An effect you pick is saved at once for this bot; Off removes the rule."
          }
